  "scope": "Original DCN1 frontend/DML, AUX/panel, clocks, SST, scanout/flip/cursor and HDMI/I2C/stream encoders. Native eDP takeover and complete boot reconstruction use the common display contract. Joint DML admits active eDP/HDMI heads with independent native presentation, mode and retirement owners. No Linux runtime. Original DCE audio and DCN1 audio/stream calls bind the actual AZ endpoint, narrow stereo ELD and confirmed video receipt to the HDA receiver-source contract."
